    "detailed_description": "This is the free Chapter 0 to <strong>Time Survivors</strong>, a rogue-like bullet hell game where you can <strong>play as legendary historical characters</strong> like Abe Lincoln, Tesla, Cleopatra, and more, each now wielding unique custom abilities that revolutionize gameplay. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455500/extras/e29ef44726af23b56fe87f5eb867e63c.webp?t=1728317352\" /></span><br>Transform into a flying ninja robot as Oda Nobunaga, create defensive barriers made of cherry trees as Abe Lincoln, or set the battlefield ablaze as Nero - the choice is yours. Each character brings<strong> a unique touch to every run</strong>, making each playthrough a unique adventure.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455500/extras/8fab3f7a41d30e949047f9d6f57af156.poster.avif?t=1728317352\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455500/extras/8fab3f7a41d30e949047f9d6f57af156.webm?t=1728317352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Travel through time and <strong>fight hordes</strong> of memorable enemies as you unravel a mystery. With over 150 different weapons, items, Relics, and buffs to choose from, every run is a unique experience. Fight skeletons in the Medieval Age, Velociraptors and T-Rexes in the Stone Age, and discover plenty of quests and secrets along the way.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455500/extras/568fd7ae3f31f8547281a0a9dc2c6ae2.webp?t=1728317352\" /></span><br>But that's not all - Time Survivors: Chapter 0 presents a new meta progression system, allowing you to unlock and upgrade characters, weapons, and stages, even <strong>game mode modifiers</strong>, using gold and resources collected during your runs. Tailor your progression to your preferred playstyle and strategically <strong>allocate resources</strong> to create your own game-breaking build.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455500/extras/6e00ba7817b70e2fd4cc9192b20ba1a4.poster.avif?t=1728317352\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455500/extras/6e00ba7817b70e2fd4cc9192b20ba1a4.webm?t=1728317352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455500/extras/6e00ba7817b70e2fd4cc9192b20ba1a4.mp4?t=1728317352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455500/extras/65e0e5df6e644f01abc1ed5f0944b5c8.webp?t=1728317352\" /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>2 stages full of enemies, secrets, mini bosses  and end-stage bosses: The Dark Age and The Stone Age<br></li><li>8 unlockable characters from the entire human history, <strong>each with their own unique ability</strong>!<br></li><li>32 different weapons and buffs to choose from for a unique experience every run<br></li><li>8 Cursed Relics<br></li><li>41 different enemies<br></li><li>35 Unlockables</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455500/extras/b581c718ee70071758d68f7d15872415.webp?t=1728317352\" /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play as epic historic characters, each with their unique ability<br></li><li>Tree-based meta progression for all elements in the game<br></li><li>Casual quick 20 minute play sessions + plenty of quests and secrets to discover<br></li><li>A Sandbox mode to test any overpowered build and train against any enemy</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455500/extras/f420ded95cbbf8b53f377e71e7a10909.poster.avif?t=1728317352\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455500/extras/f420ded95cbbf8b53f377e71e7a10909.webm?t=1728317352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><br>And since you've come this far... don't forget to <strong>wishlist the full game</strong> to stay up-to-date on the latest features and updates!",
